The SHERLOQ JavaScript implementation localizes text only. It implements
Paddle's BGR/ImageNet normalization and DB thresholds. Connected components,
convex hulls, minimum-area rectangles and rectangle offsets replace OpenCV
and PyClipper preprocessing/postprocessing dependencies. This port does not
claim byte-level parity with those libraries. Original scientific pixels
are preserved and oriented exclusions use original image coordinates.
